OL,3,GNEWSAPorridge makers from opposite
OL,4,Asides of globe triumph in world
OL,5,Achampionship
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo national porridge-making champions
OL,8,Ffrom almost opposite sides of the
OL,9,Fplanet have triumphed in the annual
OL,10,Fworld championships held in the
OL,11,FScottish Highlands.
OL,13,FGina Saarberg, 28, took the coveted
OL,14,FGolden Spurtle using the same recipe
OL,15,Fthat saw her crowned Dutch champion in
OL,16,FJuly, using organic pinhead oats, salt
OL,17,Fand water that she brought with her
OL,18,Ffrom the Netherlands.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
