OL,3,GNEWSAPorridge makers from opposite
OL,4,Asides of globe triumph in world
OL,5,Achampionship
OL,6,
OL,7,FAustralian champion Rob Reid took the
OL,8,Fspeciality award - where competitors
OL,9,Fcan combine oatmeal with any
OL,10,Fingredients - with his porridge
OL,11,Fcannoli, an oaty spin on a tube-shaped
OL,12,Fdessert that originated in Sicily.
OL,14,FThirty competitors from 14 countries
OL,15,Ftook part in the contest, held each
OL,16,Fyear at Carrbridge, just north of
OL,17,FAviemore.
